# What this module needs on the machine, name | kind | locator | policy | consumer | reason.
# The format and the kinds are documented in the repository root CLAUDE.md. This file names
# tools and never how to install one, since that mapping is DEPENDENCIES.map one layer up.
# Written by hand, because this module has no sub units to fold declarations from.
#
# Only fut is declared, and that is deliberate rather than an oversight. The config declares
# three popups pointing at tools this package does not ship yet, so nothing here runs fzf, fd,
# lazygit, lf or nvim today. Those get declared in the same change that ports the scripts,
# since a declaration is a statement that this module breaks without the tool and that is not
# true of any of them while the scripts are absent. decisions/fut-vs-herdr.md says what
# porting them costs.
